          "Body asks for azureAdPopTokenAuthentication; Learn's v1.0 create example shows the bearer type, but the security page says v1.0 defaults to PoP and recommends it",
          "authorizedApps left out: Learn shows no request that sets it; the admin center sets it in Lab 2, check-extension checks it",
